    "disposition": "The admitted program and existing bank aggregate own cancellation. The executor owns the single queued-event selection rule, shared by preflight and consumption. No wire grammar, fake scope, duplicate runtime owner, or upward Core dependency was added. Canonical fixture data is generated through the existing lowerer, not copied from Cargo build caches."
