  "accepted": [
    "Main and actual child Need cancellation preflight original scope grants and aggregate retirement capacity before accepting the Need publication cursor. Refusal retains the complete snapshot and permits the same publication to retry.",
    "Main and actual Program-child AwaitMany use the same event selection rule for admission and removal. Refusal reinstalls the extracted state, retains the queued event and leaves the deferred journal without consumed events.",
