    "After capacity is available under the unchanged handles=1/scopes=8 policy, cancellation retires the actual current body/token once, accepts the same publication/event and transitions the actual fiber to Cancelled.",
    "All five paths execute genuine suspensions. Fanout and nested Program Need use current lowerer-generated canonical AWBC, actual worker execution and actual Program retirement; no fabricated controller, receipt, Ready payload or scope grant substitutes for those owners.",
    "Successful default-policy scenarios round-trip the complete public save snapshot. Scalar String/Bool resource bodies demonstrate custody, not Source ViewValue construction or driver ABI."
  ],
